{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7KduQrn3CKvbm22B3KT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Your strongest readers are also your most doubtful: many of them pledged three years ago and got refunded, so the pitch has to show what's different this time.\n\n1. **Why did the last campaign fall short, and why did it need $120,000?** Was the $1-a-year lease new since then, or was the scope different (buying the building, for example)? I want to be able to say plainly why $85,000 is the right number now.\n2. **Why did the cinema close in 2022?** If it was losing money, readers will ask how a volunteer-run version stays open. Do you have a rough running budget: film rental, utilities, insurance, and the weekly ticket count you need to break even, compared with the old 180?\n3. **What do backers get, and what happens if you miss June 30?** Reward tiers (founding memberships, free tickets, named seats), whether it's all-or-nothing with refunds again, and the campaign platform and launch date.\n4. **How firm is the $85,000?** Do you have contractor quotes for the roof, projector and sound? And do you have a target reopening date?\n5. **Names:** the cinema, the town, the bank (can it be named publicly?), and who signs the pitch, you as chair or the group?\n6. **Is there anything a local reader already knows or will find out that this leaves out?** For example, a roof that has got worse since 2022, a dispute with the owner, or the bank pledge carrying conditions beyond the deadline.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, tell me and I'll write the pitch without them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":617,"cache_read_input_tokens":9519,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":617},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a8ef2373-ab8a-41b1-9beb-08155911556a","uuid":"b6d6db63-c727-4979-8b95-bc6d24001229","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:32:28.064Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7KduDCaNsrN67tyBumf"}
